            "summary": "Hello! This is my portfolio. Here, you'll find my introduction to you and a compilation of stuff I've made. My name is Eza, and I'm&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"post__toc\">\n<h3>Table of Contents</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k115fbhmk\">Introduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k117h3e75c\">Experience I have</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k117h3e75d\">Stuff I've Made</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k117h3e75e\">Robots</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k117h3e75f\">2026-2027 VRC Override</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1k117h3e75g\">2025-2026 VRC Push Back</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>Hello! This is my portfolio. Here, you'll find my introduction to you and a compilation of stuff I've made.</p>\n<h1 id=\"mcetoc_1k115fbhmk\">Introduction</h1>\n<p>My name is Eza, and I'm currently 17 (as of writing this). I'm a high school student, and I'm looking forward to pursuing more engineering projects in the future. I'm also the lead design and CAD for the VEX Robotics team 90385B Pumas: Bromine, and former programmer. Currently, I'm working on:<br><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developing my team's robot for the 2026-2027 VRC game Override</li>\n<li>Getting more awards for our robotics team</li>\n<li>Learning more CAM software and 3D printing</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"mcetoc_1k117h3e75c\">Experience I Have</h1>\n<h2>Programming</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proficient in C++ (since 2024), for programming in my robotics team</li>\n<li>Expert in Lua (since 2019), for developing games on the Roblox platform</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Engineering</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Novice in Fusion 360 (since 2025)</li>\n<li>Novice in Carbide Create (since 2026)</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"mcetoc_1k117h3e75d\">Stuff I've Made</h1>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1k117h3e75e\">Robots</h2>\n<h3 id=\"mcetoc_1k117h3e75f\">2026-2027 VRC Override</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020204.png\" data-size=\"1811x1149\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020204-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Clementine 1.5\" width=\"768\" height=\"487\"></a>\n<figcaption>August, 2026. Our current robot's CAD</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020451.png\" data-size=\"1623x1133\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020451-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Clementine 1.0\" width=\"768\" height=\"536\"></a>\n<figcaption>June, 2026. Our first prototype robot's CAD</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h3 id=\"mcetoc_1k117h3e75g\">2025-2026 VRC Push Back</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-021230.png\" data-size=\"1035x1061\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-021230-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Sumo 5.0\" width=\"768\" height=\"787\"></a>\n<figcaption>March, 2026. Prototype CAD that we didn't build</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020740.png\" data-size=\"1623x1138\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-020740-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Sumo 4.0\" width=\"768\" height=\"538\"></a>\n<figcaption>Februrary, 2026. Our last CAD for Push Back</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-021108.png\" data-size=\"1642x1131\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://e4za.xyz/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-08-27-021108-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Sumo 2.0\" width=\"768\" height=\"529\"></a>\n<figcaption>December, 2025. My first ever CAD</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>",
